9088-19091">千</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19091-19109"><rb>吉</rb><rt>きち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19109-19112">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19112-19136"><rb>不甲斐</rb><rt>ふがい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19136-19148">なさは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19148-19163"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19163-19172">いだす</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19172-19196"><rb>度毎</rb><rt>たびごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19196-19202">にお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19202-19217"><rb>岸</rb><rt>きし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19217-19220">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19220-19238"><rb>涙</rb><rt>なみだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19238-19241">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19241-19256"><rb>種</rb><rt>たね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19256-19277">ではあったが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19277-19289"><rb>踏</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19289-19298">まれた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19298-19313"><rb>草</rb><rt>くさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19313-19319">にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19319-19340"><rb>花咲</rb><rt>はなさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19340-19355">くたとえの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19355-19382"><rb>文字通</rb><rt>もじどお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19382-19388">り、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19388-19412"><rb>去年</rb><rt>きょねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19412-19415">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19415-19451"><rb>梅見時分</rb><rt>うめみじぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19451-19457">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19457-19484"><rb>伊勢新</rb><rt>いせしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19484-19487">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19487-19511"><rb>隠居</