      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45225-45252"><rb>三日月</rb><rt>みかづき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45252-45261">なりに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45261-45273"><rb>切</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45273-45288">ってある、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45288-45300"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45300-45327">にいれたいくらいの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45327-45342"><rb>小</rb><rt>ちい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45342-45348">さな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45348-45363"><rb>爪</rb><rt>つめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45363-45369">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45369-45393"><rb>母指</rb><rt>おやゆび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45393-45396">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45396-45420"><rb>中指</rb><rt>なかゆび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45420-45423">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45423-45438"><rb>先</rb><rt>さき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45438-45441">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45441-45456"><rb>摘</rb><rt>つま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45456-45483">んだまま、ほのかな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45483-45507"><rb>月光</rb><rt>げっこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45507-45510">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45510-45525"><rb>透</rb><rt>すか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45525-45531">した</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45531-45555"><rb>春重</rb><rt>はるしげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45555-45558">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45558-45576"><rb>面</rb><rt>おもて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45576-45585">には、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45585-45606"><rb>得意</rb><rt>とくい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45606-45609">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="righ