      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55221-55245"><rb>春重</rb><rt>はるしげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55245-55248">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55248-55266"><rb>傍</rb><rt>かたわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55266-55272">らに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55272-55284"><rb>置</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55284-55290">いた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55290-55305"><rb>紅</rb><rt>べに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55305-55308">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55308-55335"><rb>糠袋</rb><rt>ぬかぶくろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55335-55341">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55341-55359"><rb>如何</rb><rt>いか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55359-55365">にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55365-55389"><rb>大切</rb><rt>たいせつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55389-55398">そうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55398-55419"><rb>取上</rb><rt>とりあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55419-55446">げると、おもむろに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55446-55470"><rb>口紐</rb><rt>くちひも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55470-55473">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55473-55485"><rb>解</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55485-55509">いて、十ばかりの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55509-55524"><rb>爪</rb><rt>つめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55524-55527">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55527-55548"><rb>掌</rb><rt>てのひら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55548-55578">にあけたが、そのまま</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55578-55590"><rb>湯</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55590-55602">のたぎる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-55602-55623"><rb>薬罐</rb><rt>やかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-55623-55626">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" ren