ana" rend="right" source="#source-78300-78315"><rb>探</rb><rt>さぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78315-78318">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78318-78330"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78330-78336">した</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78336-78357"><rb>火口</rb><rt>ほくち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78357-78360">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78360-78372"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78372-78393">って、やっとの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78393-78408"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78408-78414">いで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78414-78438"><rb>行燈</rb><rt>あんどん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78438-78441">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78441-78453"><rb>灯</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78453-78470">をいれた。</seg></p>
