      <p><seg source="#source-79922-79925">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79925-79943"><rb>気味</rb><rt>きみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79943-79946">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79946-79961"><rb>悪</rb><rt>わる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-79961-79994">いもんじゃねえよ。よく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-79994-80006"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-80006-80009">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-80009-80021"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-80021-80036">って、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-80036-80054"><rb>匂</rb><rt>におい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-80054-80057">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-80057-80069"><rb>嗅</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-80069-80075">いで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-80075-80087"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby>ねえ」</p>
