ource-110566-110587"><rb>風情</rb><rt>ふぜい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110587-110602">。ゆうべの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110602-110623"><rb>夢見</rb><rt>ゆめみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110623-110626">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110626-110641"><rb>忘</rb><rt>わす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110641-110668">れられぬであろう。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110668-110689"><rb>葉隠</rb><rt>はがく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110689-110707">れにちょいと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110707-110722"><rb>覗</rb><rt>のぞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110722-110728">いた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110728-110755"><rb>青蛙</rb><rt>あおがえる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110755-110761">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110761-110776"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110776-110782">にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110782-110794"><rb>落</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110794-110812">ちかかった三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110812-110839"><rb>角頭</rb><rt>かくとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110839-110845">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110845-110863"><rb>陽射</rb><rt>ひざ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110863-110869">しを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110869-110884"><rb>眩</rb><rt>まば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110884-110890">ゆく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110890-110902"><rb>避</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110902-110919">けていた。</seg></p>
